    :ok
  end

  @doc "Performs action and waits for a popup `Page`. If predicate is provided, it passes [Popup] value into the\n`predicate` function and waits for `predicate(page)` to return a truthy value. Will throw an error if the page is\nclosed before the popup event is fired.\n\n## Options\n\n  * `:predicate` - Receives the `Page` object and resolves to truthy value when the waiting should resolve.\n  * `:timeout` - Maximum time to wait for in milliseconds."
  @doc since: "v1.9"
